sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Lattice Host<br/>(lower · middleware)
    participant C as Sandbox Client<br/>(upper · agent)
    participant N as NodeFile Graph<br/>(.uninode/ repo)
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>(project repo)

    %% ── Phase 1: Setup ──
    rect rgba(100, 130, 220, 0.08)
    Note right of H: Setup — restore or cold boot
    H ->> N: open .uninode/ repo
    N ->> N: check HEAD alignment<br/>(project HEAD ↔ .uninode/ tracked commit)
    alt graph stale or cold start
        N ->> FS: scan project files
        N ->> N: rebuild / incremental update
        N ->> N: git commit (.uninode/)
    end
    N -->> H: lower graph ready

    alt has good snapshot
        H ->> C: restore from last good snapshot
        Note over C: upper = snapshot(lower), near-zero cost
    else cold start
        H ->> FS: snapshot lower baseline
        H ->> C: boot(base_image, env, egress_policy)
        Note over C: upper = fresh fork(lower)
    end
    end

    %% ── Phase 2: Execution ──
    rect rgba(100, 200, 120, 0.08)
    Note right of C: Execution — agent operates on NodeFiles
    loop agent task loop
        C ->> N: read NodeFile(path)
        N ->> FS: materialize content
        FS -->> N: raw content
        N -->> C: NodeFile content

        C ->> C: reason / plan

        C ->> N: mutate NodeFile(path, new_content)
        N ->> FS: persist to project file
        activate N
        N ->> N: create OperationNode
        N ->> N: propagate effect ripples<br/>(file → symbol → import → test → build → review)
        deactivate N

        opt side-effect commands
            C ->> N: exec(cmd)
            N ->> FS: execute
            FS -->> N: observe created / deleted / modified
            N ->> N: batch OperationNodes + ripples
        end
    end
    C -->> H: execution done
    end

    %% ── Phase 3: Promote ──
    rect rgba(220, 110, 100, 0.08)
    Note right of H: Promote — CEP validate + merge
    H ->> N: collect ChangeSet
    N -->> H: ChangeSet {ops, affected, ripples}

    H ->> H: CEP boundary validate<br/>(context · authority · audit · lifecycle)

    alt PASS
        H ->> FS: git commit (project repo → lower)
        H ->> N: git commit (.uninode/ → advance graph)
        H ->> C: snapshot as new baseline
        Note over C,N: project HEAD / .uninode/ HEAD / sandbox snapshot<br/>三者同步推进
        H -->> C: ack(commit_sha)
    else REJECT
        H ->> C: discard → restore last good snapshot
        H ->> N: git reset (.uninode/ → discard upper ops)
        H -->> C: reject(violations[])
    end
    end
